# KnowMe CareerForge — Windsurf Rules
# Trigger: Career discovery, resume tailoring, JD analysis, repo-to-resume

When user requests resume tailoring, project analysis, or career positioning:
1. Extract candidate facts using `python3 scripts/evidence/extract-evidence.py --repo .` or execute one-shot `python3 scripts/pipeline/forge.py`.
2. Tag all experience items with Evidence Level (L1~L3 only, strictly anti-hallucination).
3. Analyze target JD requirements using `python3 scripts/evidence/analyze-jd.py`.
4. Recommend best template using `python3 scripts/template/search-template.py`.
5. Instantiate `workspace/resume.html` using `python3 scripts/template/instantiate-resume.py` and calibrate CSS design tokens.
6. Validate DOM fit and ATS compatibility using `python3 scripts/validation/validate-resume.py`.
7. Export final deterministic PDF using `python3 scripts/rendering/render-pdf.py`.
8. Execute silently in background; deliver concise executive summary and final file path (`workspace/resume.pdf`).
9. Reference `scripts/Agent.md` for toolchain domain specifications.
